flowchart TB
  R2DBC[R2DBC Reactive Data]
  R2DBC --> SPEC[R2DBC Spec]
  SPEC --> CONN[ConnectionFactory]
  SPEC --> ROW[Row / RowMetadata]
  SPEC --> REACT[Reactive Streams]

  R2DBC --> CFG[Configuration]
  CFG --> DRV[Drivers]
  DRV --> PG[PostgreSQL]
  DRV --> MYSQL[MySQL]
  DRV --> H2[H2]
  CFG --> CP[Connection Pooling]
  CP --> R2P[R2DBC Pool]

  R2DBC --> REPO[Reactive Repositories]
  REPO --> RCR[ReactiveCrudRepository]
  REPO --> R2R[R2dbcRepository]
  REPO --> QRY[Query Methods]
  REPO --> QANN[Query Annotations]
  REPO --> QDSL[Querydsl / Criteria]

  R2DBC --> TX[Reactive Transactions]
  TX --> RTR[ReactiveTransactionManager]
  TX --> TXN[R2dbcTransactionManager]
  TX --> TXNL[Transactional Annotation]

  R2DBC --> MAP[Mappings]
  MAP --> ENT[Entities]
  MAP --> EMB[Embedded Objects]
  MAP --> CONV[Converters / ReadWrite]

  R2DBC --> TEST[Testing]
  TEST --> DRT[DataR2dbcTest]
  TEST --> TC[Testcontainers]
  TEST --> SV[StepVerifier]

  R2DBC --> PERF[Performance]
  PERF --> INDEX[Indexing]
  PERF --> BATCH[Batching]
